                      <SHORT-NAME>AdcDeInitApi</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">Adds / removes the service Adc_DeInit() from the code.</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <INTRODUCTION>
                        <P>
