                      <SHORT-NAME>CV2xMainFunctionPeriod</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">Specifies the period of main function CV2x_MainFunction in seconds. Cellular V2X driver does not require this information but the BSW scheduler.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="EN">Tags: atp.Status=draft</L-2>
