                              <SHORT-NAME>CanIfHthIdSymRef</SHORT-NAME>
                              <DESC>
                                <L-2 L="EN">The parameter refers to a particular HTH object in the CanDrv configuration (see CanHardwareObject or CanXLHardwareObject).</L-2>
                              </DESC>
                              <INTRODUCTION>
                                <P>
