                          <SHORT-NAME>CanNmPnEnabled</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">Enables or disables support of partial networking.</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <INTRODUCTION>
                            <P>
                              <L-1 L="EN">false: Partial networking Range not supported true: Partial networking supported</L-1>
                            </P>
