                              <SHORT-NAME>CanTrcvPowerOnFlag</SHORT-NAME>
                              <DESC>
                                <L-2 L="EN">Description: Indicates if the Power On Reset (POR) flag is available and is managed by the transceiver.</L-2>
                              </DESC>
