                          <SHORT-NAME>ComMUserEcucPartitionRef</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">Denotes in which "EcucPartition" the requester is executed. When the partition is stopped, the communication request shall be cancelled in the ComM</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <INTRODUCTION>
                            <P>
                              <L-1 L="EN">to avoid a stay-awake situation of the bus due to a stopped partition.</L-1>
                            </P>
                          </INTRODUCTION>
