                                              <SHORT-NAME>DcmDataElementInstanceRef</SHORT-NAME>
                                              <DESC>
                                                <L-2 L="EN">Instance Reference to the primitive or array data which shall be read or written.</L-2>
                                              </DESC>
                                              <INTRODUCTION>
                                                <P>
                                                  <L-1 L="EN">Supported are VariableDataPrototypes in SenderReceiverInterfaces and NvDataInterfaces and ParameterDataPrototypes in ParameterInterfaces (read only). This reference is applicable if the AutosarDataPrototype is typed with a ApplicationPrimitiveDataType of category VALUE or BOOLEAN or ApplicationArrayDataType or if the AutosarDataPrototype is typed with a ImplementationDataType of category VALUE, ARRAY or TYPE_REFERENCE that in turn boils down to VALUE or ARRAY</L-1>
                                                </P>
                                              </INTRODUCTION>
                                              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_00991</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
