                                  </DESC>
                                  <INTRODUCTION>
                                    <P>
                                      <L-1 L="EN">This delay indicates the time at ECU boot power-on time during which the Dcm does not accept a security access. min: A negative value is not allowed.</L-1>
                                    </P>
                                  </INTRODUCTION>
