                        <!-- Container Definition: DemCallbackEventDataChanged -->
                        <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:48673ef9-0ee2-44e2-a4da-c56610dd6792">
                          <SHORT-NAME>DemCallbackEventDataChanged</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">The presence of this container indicates that the Dem has access to an "EventDataChanged" callback.</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <INTRODUCTION>
                            <P>
                              <L-1 L="EN">In case there is a DemCallbackEventDataChangedFnc, this parameter defines the name of the function that the Dem will call. In case there is no DemCallbackEventDataChangedFnc, the Dem will have an R-Port requiring the interface CallbackEventDataChanged whose name is generated by using the unique callback-prefix followed by the event name.</L-1>
                            </P>
