                      <SHORT-NAME>DltGeneralVersionInfoApi</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">Pre-processor switch for enabling Version Info API support.</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <INTRODUCTION>
                        <P>
                          <L-1 L="EN">* True: version information API activated * False: version information API deactivated</L-1>
                        </P>
                      </INTRODUCTION>
