                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">Timeout in [s] for maximum inactivity of a TCP socket connection before the DoIP module will close the according socket connection. Represents parameter T_TCP_General_Inactivity of ISO 13400-2.</L-2>
                          </DESC>
