                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">The function checks for new received Ethernet frames at the related Ethernet controller and the related ingress queue referenced via EthIfPhysCtrlRxIngressQueueRef, or at the related CanXL controller and the related ingress FIFO referenced via EthIfCanXLCtrlRxIngressFifoRef.</L-2>
