                      </DESC>
                      <INTRODUCTION>
                        <P>
                          <L-1 L="EN">module shall report to the IdsM in case the coresponding security related event occurs (and if EthTSynEnableSecurityEventReportings set to "true"). The standardized security events in this container can be extended by vendor-specific security events.</L-1>
                        </P>
                      </INTRODUCTION>
