                          <SHORT-NAME>EthTrcvPhysLayerPlcaMaxBurstTimer</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">Limits the burst frames in bit time. The maximum burst time could differ per ECU within a PLCA mixed segment.</L-2>
                          </DESC>
