                      <SHORT-NAME>FlsTstBlockNumberBgnd</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">This parameter shall represent the number of test blocks available for the background test.</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <INTRODUCTION>
                        <P>
                          <L-1 L="EN">calculationFormula = Number of configured FlsTstBlocks in the FlsTstBlockBgndConfigSet (or 0 if no FlsTstBlocks are configured).</L-1>
                        </P>
                      </INTRODUCTION>
