                          <SHORT-NAME>FrPMicroInitialOffsetB</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">Number of microticks between the secondary time reference point</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <INTRODUCTION>
                            <P>
                              <L-1 L="EN">and the macrotick boundary immediately following the secondary time reference point. The parameter depends on FrPDelayCompensationB and therefore it has to be set independently for each channel [Microticks].</L-1>
                            </P>
                          </INTRODUCTION>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Fr_00418</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
