                      <SHORT-NAME>IpduMStaticPartExists</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">This is to allow optimizations in the case the IpduM will never be used with a static part.</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <INTRODUCTION>
                        <P>
                          <L-1 L="EN">Note that this is a pre-compile option. If this is set to False then it will not be possible to add static parts after compilation. True: A static part may exist. False: A static part will never exist.</L-1>
                        </P>
                      </INTRODUCTION>
