                              <SHORT-NAME>J1939TpRxDirectNPdu</SHORT-NAME>
                              <DESC>
                                <L-2 L="EN">This N-PDU represents the short frame that is used for a dynamic length PGN when it has a length of less that 8 bytes. This N-PDU consumes a meta data item of type CAN_ID_32.</L-2>
                              </DESC>
                              <INTRODUCTION>
                                <P>
                                  <L-1 L="EN">Please note: This sub container is only necessary when J1939TpRxPgDynLength is TRUE.</L-1>
                                </P>
