                              <SHORT-NAME>NmStandardBusType</SHORT-NAME>
                              <DESC>
                                <L-2 L="EN">Identifies the bus type of the channel for standard AUTOSAR &lt;Bus&gt;Nms and is used to determine which set of API calls to be called by Nm for the &lt;Bus&gt;Nms.</L-2>
                              </DESC>
