                              <SHORT-NAME>PortPinDirection</SHORT-NAME>
                              <DESC>
                                <L-2 L="EN">The initial direction of the pin (IN or OUT). If the direction is not changeable, the value configured here is fixed.</L-2>
                              </DESC>
                              <INTRODUCTION>
                                <P>
                                  <L-1 L="EN">The direction must match the pin mode. E.g. a pin used for an ADC must be configured to be an in port. Implementation Type: Port_PinDirectionType</L-1>
                                </P>
                              </INTRODUCTION>
                              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Port_00125</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
