                                        <L-2 L="EN">Reference to a SoAdRoutingGroup for activation of the data path for a subscribed client (start sending events after subscribe). This is usually equal to the SdEventActivationRef referenced by SdEventHandlerUdp</L-2>
                                      </DESC>
