                          <SHORT-NAME>SecOCSecuredRxPduOffset</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">This parameter defines the start position (offset in bytes) of the area within the Pdu which is secured</L-2>
                          </DESC>
