                          <SHORT-NAME>SoAdSocketPathMTUEnable</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">Specifies if path MTU discovery shall be performed for this connection. If this optional parameter is not available the default behavior configured for the controller in the TcpIp module via the parameter TcpIpIpV4PathMtuEnabled or TcpIpIpV6PathMtuEnabled is applied.</L-2>
                          </DESC>
