                        <P>
                          <L-1 L="EN">The defintions are separated in a set of defintions in order to enable an holistic view about all exsiting Software Cluster Definitions.</L-1>
                        </P>
                      </INTRODUCTION>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_SwCluC_00006</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
