                          <SHORT-NAME>SwCluCFiMProxyBaseSocket</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">This container configures how many EcucPartitions specific API links are required for the FiM Proxy and to which cluster resource the API set belongs.</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <INTRODUCTION>
                            <P>
                              <L-1 L="EN">In the FiM Low Proxy all offered API sets needs to be configured. In the FiM High Proxy only the ones are configured which are offered inside this Application Software Cluster. The reference SwCluCProxyEcucPartitionRef denotes the EcucPartition on which the API set is provided.</L-1>
                            </P>
                          </INTRODUCTION>
