                              <SHORT-NAME>TcpIpIntegrityTransformIdentifier</SHORT-NAME>
                              <DESC>
                                <L-2 L="EN">Integrity algorithm transform identifier. Parameter values are defined as per IETF RFC 7296 3.3.2</L-2>
                              </DESC>
