                      <SHORT-NAME>UdpNmImmediateRestartEnabled</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">Pre-processor switch for enabling the immediate transmission of a NM PACKET upon bus-communication request in Prepare-Bus-Sleep mode.</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <INTRODUCTION>
                        <P>
                          <L-1 L="EN">Must not be defined if UdpNmPassiveModeEnabled== true.</L-1>
                        </P>
                      </INTRODUCTION>
